[General] Copy/paste bug: `FRAMED_TRANSPORT` resolves to `TFastFramedTransport`, the same class as `FAST_FRAMED_TRANSPORT` below. The `TFramedTransport` branch in `getSocket(...)` therefore never matches a `TFramedTransport` instance, and its inner `transport_` socket is not unwrapped. This should reference `org.apache.thrift.transport.TFramedTransport`.

```suggestion
  private static final Class<?> FRAMED_TRANSPORT =
      getClass("org.apache.thrift.transport.TFramedTransport");
```

